        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "99 Rafters Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present new to the market no.99 Rafters Road. Located in the heart of Drimnagh, this beautiful 2 bed property is destined to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nNumber 99 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, parks, cafes, sports facilities, primary and secondary schools. It is also within close proximity to areas such as Crumlin and Rialto. \r\n\r\nWalking up the driveway and through the elegant porch you enter a fantastic open plan ground floor. With a mix of modern and contemporary decor, this space is a perfect example of modern living, with plenty of space for the hustle and bustle of family life. A spacious and airy living room is the forefront of this space. Past this, through a set of classic French doors, you have a modern and fully equipped extended kitchen. The flow of the ground floor would make the perfect entertaining space as well.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a private and fully paved South East facing garden complete with a block built shed to the very end. A tranquil and comfy space which adds to the vibe of the rest of the property.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two bedrooms, a double to the rear and a second larger double to the front aspect. A fully complete family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nRafters Road benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running throughout the area making the commute to and from the City Centre as easy as it can be. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.  \r\n\r\nThe opportunity to acquire such a marvellous property is not one to be missed so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Extended\r\n- End terrace\r\n- Side entrance\r\n- Off street parking"
      },
      {
